    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo, angu hoku ilaghiro ja kungia kuhorenyi jiduagha, ndediobuo; isechekaia mndungi onyu kuwoneka walemwa ni kungia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu Ilagho Jiboie jereredeloghe kodu, sa iji koni jereghenjeroghe kwawo; ela agho malagho wereghisikireghe wikaghisowia fwaida, kwa kukaia ndewereghiwusireghe kwa irumirio anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu isi dimerie kurumiria, dangia uko kuhora, seji Mlungu ughambie,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana isi ndedifunge ndighi kukungia kuja kuhora, eri mndungi usecheghushwa ni kuja kulegha kusikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu ilagho ja Mlungu jeko moyo, sena jawadie ndighi, sena jakalie kuchumba lufu lukalie chia rose; najo jadunga na kuvikia irangi na roho, hata kuvikia mawungo na wusuchi; jikitambua maghesho na maririkanyo gha ngolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata imbiri ya Mlungu, ndekuwadie iumbo jingi jivisikie; ela vilambo vose veko worinyi, viwikilo na kufunukulwa imbiri ya meso ghake, uo dichaafunya mitalo edu kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jesu Mkohani M'baa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idana kwa kukaia deko na Mkohani M'baa, uo orengirieghe mlungunyi, Jesu, Mwana wa Mlungu, ndedimazire kuja kurumiria kodu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angu uo Mkohani M'baa diko nao, ndedimagha kulemwa ni kuwadwa ni wughoma kwa wundu ghwa wunyonge ghodu anduangi; ela uo oretimiloghe kwa kula chia seji koni dawuyatimwa, ela nderebonyereghe kaung'a anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ndedisoghode kaavui na kifumbi cha wughoma kwa wuwana, eri dipate kufuilwa wughoma, na kupata mvono ghoditesia ngelo ghukundikagha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
